  <!-- EN: nearby ruins found -->
  <Quest_PristineRuins.label>發現附近遺跡</Quest_PristineRuins.label>
  <!-- EN: Pristine ruins found nearby -->
  <Quest_PristineRuins.letterLabel>附近發現完整遺跡</Quest_PristineRuins.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: {0}, {1} of {2}, has sent us a message.\n\nTheir scouts have discovered an old complex in almost untouched condition. Nobody knows where and why former dwellers have gone, so you should be prepared for anything. Rumors fly fast, so you will most likely not be the only one who wants to claim the treasure. And since the treasure can be enormous, so can the hostile forces. And please hurry, in {3} days you won't find anything besides bare walls. -->
  <Quest_PristineRuins.letterText>{2}的{1}{0}傳來一則訊息。\n\n他們的偵察兵發現了一座幾乎完好如初的古老建築群。沒人知道原本的住戶去了哪裡、為什麼離開，所以你最好做好面對任何狀況的準備。傳言散播得很快，想奪取這批寶藏的人多半不只你一個。寶藏可能非常豐厚，敵對勢力也可能同樣龐大。請盡快行動，{3}天後那裡就只剩下光禿禿的牆壁了。</Quest_PristineRuins.letterText>

  <!-- EN: small ruins found -->
  <SmallRuinsFound.label>發現小型遺跡</SmallRuinsFound.label>

